      "observation": "The scrolled desktop exercise viewport shows the tall figure rather than the exercise stem. Two dark steep curves and one lighter shallow curve have visible continuous ink on a pale grid; all three approach the same visible meeting point near the y-axis. The labels y = (1/3)^x, y = 0.25^x and y = 0.8^x are bold and readable without covering each other. Y-axis ticks 1 through 8 are distinct. The lower x-axis is outside this viewport; this screenshot alone is not treated as a whole-figure view."
